==============================================================================
MAYER / VIRIAL CLUSTER (URSELL) EXPANSION OF THE OCF HARD-CORE GAS
  Xi(z) = I(Omega, z) = sum_k alpha_k z^k  (hard-core gas, fugacity z).
  H = I(Omega, 2).   log I(Omega,z) = sum_{k>=1} c_k z^k  (cumulants).
  TWO Ursell families:
   * graphical/excluded-volume virial b_k: b1=alpha_1, b2=-|E|, b3=P2-t.
   * analytic Taylor cumulants c_k: c2 = alpha_2 - alpha_1^2/2 = -|E| - alpha_1/2.
   They differ by the single-particle self-overlap (c_k includes diagonals).
==============================================================================

========== n = 4  (ALL labelled tournaments) ==========
