  (a1) b_1 = alpha_1 = |V(Omega)|                : failures = 0
  (a2) b_2 = -|E(Omega)|                         : failures = 0
  (a2) b_2 = alpha_2 - C(alpha_1,2)              : failures = 0
  (a3) b_3 = P2(Omega) - t(Omega)  (Ursell)      : failures = 0
  (b)  exp(sum c_k z^k) == I(Omega,z) [EXACT PS] : failures = 0
  (b)  log I = sum_k c_k z^k at SMALL z (in disk): failures = 0
  (c)  H_free = 3^alpha_1 >= H                   : failures = 0
  (c)  H_free == H  IFF  Omega edgeless          : failures = 0
       OCF I(Omega,2) == direct Ham-path count   : failures = 0
